  "handoff_summary": {
    "completed": "All three acceptance criteria met. RecipeCatalog threading is correct (isLoading set synchronously, scan runs in Task.detached, all mutations published on MainActor). All obsolete discovery paths (RecipeDiscovery.swift, RecipeFile.swift, and their tests) are fully removed with no dangling references. RecipesListView, MealPlanDetailView, and AppRoot are correctly wired to the catalog. Tests cover scan behavior, search filter logic, reload semantics, entry lookup, and display-name correctness. Architecture doc accurately reflects the shipped implementation.",
