    "design_decisions": "Catalog-first lookup in MealPlanDetailView with inline disk fallback for stale references is correct and eliminates double-parsing for the common path. @MainActor at class level avoids explicit MainActor.run blocks on property mutations. RecipeEntry.== compares by URL only \u2014 intentional since Recipe is not Equatable.",
    "test_coverage_notes": "RecipeCatalogTests: empty folder, root-level grouping, subfolder grouping, alpha sort, noFolder last, malformed file omission, reload add/delete, entry lookup. RecipesListViewTests: empty query, section pruning, display-name filter, case-insensitivity, no-match, multi-section match. RecipeEntryTests: standard/uppercase/non-cook extension display names. MealPlanDetailViewTests: instantiation, swipe-delete persistence, unique recipe count dedup, block search filtering.",
    "known_limitations": "Concurrent reload calls race to completion (last writer wins); coalescing deferred. Preview environment injection missing in MealPlanDetailView and RecipesTab \u2014 Xcode previews will crash for those views. Neither affects production behaviour."
